<title>USA: Tacoma, Wash., $3 mln won by Baird. [CORRECTED 19:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Tacoma, Wash., $3 mln won by Baird. [CORRECTED 19:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
